# The format of this file is identical to `.dockerignore`.
# It is used to reduce the size of deployed images to make the process of publishing faster.

# No need to store the pnpm store twice.
.local
/generated-artifacts/
**/signing-private.base64
**/admin-token.txt
**/.social-najhin-offline-issuer/
artifacts/social-omni-desktop/desktop/browser-runtime/
artifacts/social-omni-desktop/public/downloads/native-*
